Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.89,0:04:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?\NGoddamn son of a bitch...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.31,0:04:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddamn son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.03,0:04:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.47,0:05:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.99,0:05:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.16,0:05:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong\Nwith this picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice night for a walk, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.51,0:05:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice night for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Washday tomorrow.\NNothing clean, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.27,0:05:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing clean. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.14,0:05:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this guy's a couple\Ncans short of a six-pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.36,0:05:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.59,0:05:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Give them to me. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.23,0:05:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck you, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.49,0:06:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sugar, how about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.50,0:06:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to put up\Nwith that bullshit, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.20,0:06:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She's always after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.17,0:06:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't... I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.17,0:07:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy. Did you just\Nsee a real bright light?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.82,0:07:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,See that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hold it right there!\N- He's rabbiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey! I said hold it!\N- Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:08:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That son of a bitch took my pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.13,0:08:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- What day is it? The date!\N- 12th... May. Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.43,0:08:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- What year?!\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.20,0:09:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got my gun! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}3831, they lost the suspect.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard it for me, big buns.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hi.\N- Hi. I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.95,0:12:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm in it.\N- So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.77,0:13:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, could I have\Nthat coffee now, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.72,0:13:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- OK, who gets the burly beef?\N- Uh, I ordered barbecued beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.43,0:13:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- I think that's mine, but I didn't order fries.\N- He gets the barbecued beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.79,0:13:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mine's the chili beef deluxe.\N- OK, who gets the burly beef?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Miss, we're ready to order now.\N- Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.33,0:13:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so sorry. Oh, lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't real leather, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.76,0:13:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This special sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.11,0:13:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice going, kid. Ought\Nto give you the tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.18,0:13:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at it this way... in a hundred\Nyears, who's going to care?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.50,0:13:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The twelve-gauge auto-loader.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.87,0:13:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Italian. You\Ncan go pump or auto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.50,0:13:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The .45 long slide,\Nwith laser sighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.43,0:14:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,These are brand-new. We just\Ngot them in. That's a good gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.48,0:14:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just touch the trigger, the beam\Ncomes on, and you put the red dot
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.15,0:14:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,where you want the bullet\Nto go. You can't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.97,0:14:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.39,0:14:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A phased plasma rifle\Nin the 40-watt range.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.99,0:14:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what you see, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.08,0:14:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Uzi 9mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.01,0:14:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You know your weapons, buddy. Any one\Nof these is ideal for home defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.35,0:14:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh... which will it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.80,0:14:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I may close early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.59,0:14:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a 15-day wait on the handguns,\Nbut the rifles you can take right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, baby. Yeah, yeah, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.05,0:15:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I need you to come pick\Nme up. My bike just broke down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.28,0:15:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you're doing.\NCome and get me. What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.15,0:15:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, you got a\Nserious attitude problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.34,0:16:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sarah Connor?\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.56,0:16:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on my break, Chuck.\NCarla's got my station.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.03,0:16:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sarah, come here!\NIt's about you. I mean, sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.22,0:16:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so incredible. You're\Nnot gonna believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.30,0:16:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down. You are\Ngoing to love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.41,0:16:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Shh!\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.21,0:16:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Has been compiled\Nfrom several witnesses.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.78,0:16:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Once again, Sarah Connor,\Nthirty-five, mother of two,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.05,0:16:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}brutally shot to death\Nin her home this afternoon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.47,0:16:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're dead, honey.\N{\i1}- In other late-breaking news,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}teamster representatives\Nhave issued a statement...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.74,0:20:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, friends, if you're into\Nstereo and you're into sound,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.81,0:20:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}for the greatest sound around you, come to\NBob's Stereo at 25000 Sepulveda Boulevard.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.82,0:20:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, we've got woofers, tweeters, the newest\Nin digital audio and compact laser discs.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.85,0:20:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We've got graphic equalizers and sound\Nbalancers that adjust the sound to fit...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.20,0:21:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}First, I'm gonna rip the buttons\Noff your blouse, one by one,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and then run my tongue down your\Nneck to your bare, gleaming breasts,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.74,0:21:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and then slowly, slowly pull\Nyour jeans off... inch by inch.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.91,0:21:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginger, it's Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.73,0:21:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And lick your belly in circles\Nfurther{\i0} and further down,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and then pull your panties{\i0}\Noff with my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.43,0:21:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who {\i1}is{\i0} this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.22,0:21:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I, uh... Sarah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.49,0:21:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, Jesus. I'm sorry.\NI thought you were...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.20,0:21:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can I talk to Ginger, please?\N- Sure, Bunky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.34,0:21:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.94,0:21:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'm gonna rip the buttons\Noff your blouse, one by one...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.47,0:21:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You fuckin' pigs! Wait till\NI get my hands on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.12,0:21:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Get off of me!\N- Sit down, fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.22,0:22:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.69,0:22:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you got?\N- Dead girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.86,0:22:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- I can see that.\N- Sarah Ann Connor, secretary, 35,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.63,0:22:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,shot six times at less than ten\Nfeet. Large caliber weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.64,0:22:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, these work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.77,0:22:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.37,0:22:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead girl 2, sent over from\NValley Division this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.05,0:22:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm sure there's a point to all of this.\N- Look at the name, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.27,0:22:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sarah Louise... Connor.\NIs this right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.76,0:22:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.22,0:22:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The press is going to be\Nshort-stroking it all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.99,0:22:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A one-day pattern killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.04,0:22:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate the weird ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.90,0:22:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.21,0:22:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Better than mortal man deserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.75,0:23:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ginger, have you seen Pugsley?\N- No, not lately. Did you check messages?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.09,0:23:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh. I thought you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.16,0:23:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hi, Sarah, this is your mom...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.19,0:23:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.64,0:23:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- You mind your mother.\N{\i1}- So call me back, will you, dear? Uh, bye.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.95,0:23:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hi, Sarah. Dan Moorski.\NUh, something's come up,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.22,0:23:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and it looks like I won't\Nbe able to make it tonight.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.79,0:23:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just can't get out of it. Look, I'm\Nreally sorry. I'll make it up to you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.33,0:23:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Call you in a day or so,\NOK? Sorry. Bye.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.73,0:23:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That bum. So what if\Nhe has a Porsche?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.20,0:23:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't treat you like this. It's\NFriday night, for Christ's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.08,0:23:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.11,0:23:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll break his kneecaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.08,0:23:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... Pugsley still loves\Nme, don't you, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.19,0:23:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,God. It's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.62,0:23:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm gonna go to a movie, kiddo.\N- OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.54,0:24:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- You and Matt have a good time.\N- We will. You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.74,0:24:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.85,0:24:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.29,0:25:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.89,0:25:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant, are you aware\Nthat these two killings
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.69,0:25:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,occurred in the same order as\Ntheir listings in the phone book?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.06,0:25:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what can I tell you\Nguys? No comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.37,0:25:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But, lieutenant, we've\Ngot two murders...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.31,0:25:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- That coffee's two hours cold.\N- Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.75,0:25:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I put a cigarette out in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.89,0:25:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did you reach the next girl yet?\N- No. I keep getting an answering machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.29,0:25:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Send a unit.\N- I sent a unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.69,0:25:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no answer at the door, and\Nthe apartment manager's not home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.26,0:25:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.09,0:25:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- I just called her.\N- Call her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.90,0:25:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.29,0:25:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hi there.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.33,0:26:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ha ha ha. Fooled you. You're talking to\Na machine, but don't be shy, it's OK.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.22,0:26:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Same shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.13,0:26:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear it now. He's gonna be called\Nthe goddamn "Phone Book killer."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.20,0:26:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate these press cases,\Nespecially the weird press cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.80,0:26:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where you going?\N- To make a statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.66,0:26:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe make these jackals\Nwork for us for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.09,0:26:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can get on the tube by eleven\No'clock, maybe she'll call us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.65,0:26:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.35,0:26:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- How do I look?\N- Like shit, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.34,0:26:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.84,0:26:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.94,0:26:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This just in. Police have\Nannounced the name of the victim{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.16,0:26:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}in the second of two execution-style\Nmurders which took place today.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.14,0:26:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Incredibly, the names of the two\Nvictims are virtually identical.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.55,0:26:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Two hours ago, 35-year-old Sarah Ann\NConnor was pronounced dead at the scene{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.72,0:27:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- in her Santa Monica apartment...{\i0}\N- Can we change this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.81,0:27:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sure.\N{\i1}- Sarah Louise Connor was slain by an...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.37,0:27:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't touch it!\N{\i1}- Unknown gunman earlier today in her home.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.89,0:27:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, police are refusing to speculate\Non the apparent similarity{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.65,0:27:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}between these shooting deaths, and no\Nother connection between the two victims{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.38,0:27:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}has been established as of yet.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.59,0:27:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course, we'll have more on this\Nlate-breaking story as it comes in.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.66,0:27:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A spectacular fire fueled by solvents,\Noils, and other flammable liquids{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.36,0:27:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}swept through an oil company\Non North Spring Street{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.10,0:27:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}just northeast of Chinatown\NWednesday night...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.01,0:28:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, you got a phone?\N- It's in the back! Hey! 4.50.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.29,0:29:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You have reached the Los Angeles\NPolice Department emergency number.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.58,0:29:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All our lines are busy. If you\Nneed a police car sent out to you,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.12,0:29:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}please stay on the line.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.60,0:29:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}2-11 in progress at Bob's Liquor,\Ncorner of third and Cameron.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.63,0:30:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Pugsley, shoo! Go on. I'm going\Nto make a belt out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.96,0:31:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.67,0:31:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me bust you up, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.18,0:32:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hi there. Ha ha ha. Fooled you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.41,0:32:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're talking to a machine,\Nbut don't be shy, it's OK.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.68,0:32:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Machines need love\Ntoo, so talk to it,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.29,0:32:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and Ginger, that's me, or\NSarah will get back to you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.31,0:32:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait for the beep.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.16,0:32:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ginger, this is Sarah!\NPick up if you're there!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.58,0:32:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm at this place on Pico Boulevard\Ncalled Technoir. I'm really scared.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.77,0:32:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that there's\Nsomebody's after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.92,0:32:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I hope that you\Nplay this back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.42,0:32:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need you and Matt to come and\Npick me up as soon as possible.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.81,0:32:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The police keep transferring me around.\NI'm gonna give them another try.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.70,0:32:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The number here is 555-9175.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.86,0:32:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Call me, kiddo. I need your help.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.40,0:33:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.77,0:33:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sarah Connor? It's Lieutenant Traxler.\N- {\i1}Look, Lieutenant,{\i0} don't put me on hold
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.89,0:33:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- and don't transfer me to another department!\N- Don't worry. I won't. Now, just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.02,0:33:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can you tell me where you are?\N{\i1}- I'm in this bar called Technoir.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.09,0:33:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know. It's on Pico.\NAre you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.85,0:33:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I don't want to leave.\NI think there's a guy following me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.25,0:33:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now, listen, Miss\NConnor, now, listen carefully,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.76,0:33:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you're in a public place, so\Nyou'll be safe till we get there,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.32,0:33:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but stay visible. Don't go outside\Nor even to the rest room.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.16,0:33:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- I'll have a car there in a hot minute.{\i0}\N- OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.99,0:34:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that guy didn't pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.72,0:36:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me if you want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.01,0:36:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.95,0:38:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is 1-L19. I got a\Nhit-and-run felony.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.71,0:38:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Suspect vehicle... late model gray\NFord, headed westbound on 7th.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.19,0:38:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's really moving, punching\Nlights all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.63,0:38:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need an ambulance\Nat 7th and Broadway right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.92,0:38:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.99,0:38:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All units watch for a\Nlate-model gray Ford,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.73,0:38:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}last seen westbound\Non 7th and Broadway.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.97,0:38:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.96,0:38:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you injured? Are you shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.70,0:39:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.09,0:39:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do exactly what I say. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.53,0:39:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move unless I say. Don't\Nmake a sound unless I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.46,0:39:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.67,0:39:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you understand?!\N- Yes! Yes! Please, don't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.52,0:39:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to help you. I'm\NReese, Sergeant Techcom,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.29,0:39:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,DN38416, assigned to protect you.\NYou've been targeted for termination.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.50,0:39:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Attempt to intercept, 1-L19.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.97,0:39:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is 1-L19. Westbound on\NOlympic approaching Overland.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.15,0:40:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a mistake.\NI didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.45,0:40:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but you will. It's very\Nimportant that you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.43,0:40:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't true. How could that\Nman just get up after you...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.18,0:40:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not a man. A machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.90,0:40:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A Terminator. A Cyberdine\Nsystems model 101.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.02,0:40:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.52,0:40:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- Like a robot?\N- Not a robot. A cyborg.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.21,0:40:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A cybernetic organism.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.82,0:40:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- No. He was bleeding.\N- Just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.92,0:40:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your head down!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.98,0:41:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, listen. The Terminator's\Nan infiltration unit...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.52,0:41:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,part man, part machine. Underneath,\Nit's a hyperalloy combat chassis...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.19,0:41:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,microprocessor controlled,\Nfully armored, very tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.95,0:41:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But outside, it's\Nliving human tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.72,0:41:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Flesh, skin, hair, blood...\Ngrown for the cyborgs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.94,0:41:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Reese, I don't know\Nwhat you want from...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.51,0:41:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay attention! I got\Nto ditch this car.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.95,0:42:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The 600 series had rubber\Nskin. We spotted them easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.97,0:42:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But these are new.\NThey look human...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.60,0:42:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweat, bad breath, everything.\NVery hard to spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.79,0:42:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to wait till he moved on\Nyou before I could zero him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.16,0:42:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Look... I am not stupid, you know.\NThey cannot make things like that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.28,0:42:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet. Not for about forty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.62,0:42:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you saying it's from the future?\N- One possible future.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.66,0:42:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,From your point of view...\NI don't know tech stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.12,0:42:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're from the future,\Ntoo, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.99,0:42:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Right.\N- Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.05,0:42:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyborgs don't feel pain. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.87,0:42:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.42,0:42:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just let me go.\N- Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.02,0:42:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And understand. That\NTerminator is out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.41,0:43:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be bargained with.\NIt can't be reasoned with.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.85,0:43:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't feel pity\Nor remorse or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.15,0:43:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And it absolutely\Nwill not stop. Ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.19,0:43:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Until you are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.10,0:43:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.09,0:43:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.39,0:43:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,With these weapons, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.41,0:43:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All units. All units. Gray Ford\Nsuspect vehicle's been found{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.33,0:43:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}in a parking structure\Nat 4th and Beaudry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.09,0:44:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Reese.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.41,0:44:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.42,0:44:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does it want me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.91,0:44:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a nuclear war...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.81,0:45:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A few years from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.55,0:45:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All this...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.45,0:45:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole place. Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.32,0:45:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.56,0:45:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.59,0:45:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There were survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.66,0:45:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.52,0:45:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody even knew who started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.52,0:45:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the machines, Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.06,0:45:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't understand.\N- Defense network computers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.03,0:45:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,New... powerful...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.17,0:45:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooked into everything.\NTrusted to run it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.97,0:45:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They say it got smart...\Na new order of intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.00,0:45:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it saw {\i1}all{\i0} people as a threat,\Nnot just the ones on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.52,0:45:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Decided our fate in\Na microsecond...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.99,0:46:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,extermination.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.04,0:46:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see this war?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.02,0:46:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I grew up after it...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.51,0:46:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In the ruins. Starving...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.81,0:46:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hiding from HKs.\N- HKs?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.23,0:46:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunter-killers. Patrol machines\Nbuilt in automated factories.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.95,0:46:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of us were rounded up, put\Nin camps for orderly disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.44,0:46:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This was burned in\Nby laser scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.08,0:47:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of us were\Nkept alive... to work...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.37,0:47:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Loading bodies. The disposal\Nunits ran night and day.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.89,0:47:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We were that close\Nto going out forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.73,0:47:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But there was one man\Nwho taught us to fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.67,0:47:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,to storm the wire of the camps, to smash\Nthose metal motherfuckers into junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.44,0:47:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He turned it around. He brought\Nus back from the brink.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.65,0:47:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,His name was Connor. John Connor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.38,0:47:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your son, Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.02,0:47:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your unborn son.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.70,0:49:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.94,0:49:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Reese!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.79,0:50:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Reese! No! No!\NNo! They'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.36,0:50:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You in the Cadillac!\NLet me see your hands now!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.25,0:50:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.49,0:50:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop to your knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.73,0:50:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Out of the car.\N- Drop to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.12,0:50:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sarah...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.09,0:50:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sarah, try to drink some of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.16,0:50:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, are you sure it's them? Maybe...\Nmaybe I should look at the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.35,0:51:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No. They've been identified,\Nand there's no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.16,0:51:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.32,0:51:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,God!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.06,0:51:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginger!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.40,0:51:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.67,0:51:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sarah, this is Dr. Silberman.\N- Hi, Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.57,0:51:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to tell him\Neverything that Reese told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.62,0:51:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you feel up to that?\N- Yeah. I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.83,0:51:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.96,0:51:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Criminal psychologist.\N- Is Reese crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.68,0:51:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's what\Nwe're gonna find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.30,0:53:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're a soldier,\Nfighting for whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.44,0:53:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,With the 132nd, under\NPerry. From '21 to '27.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.05,0:53:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's the year 2027?\N- That's right. And I was assigned...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.87,0:53:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fucking great.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.54,0:53:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The last two years\Nunder John Connor.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.88,0:53:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who was the enemy again?\N- A computer defense system built for...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.19,0:53:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.75,0:53:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Built for SAC-NORAD\Nby Cyberdine systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.15,0:53:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.15,0:53:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And this, uh, computer thinks it can win\Nby killing the mother of its enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.29,0:53:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,killing him, in effect,\Nbefore he's even conceived,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.91,0:53:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,a sort of retroactive abortion?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.58,0:53:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy Silberman cracks me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.08,0:53:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Last week, he had this guy in here that\Nburned his Afghan. He screwed it first,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.87,0:53:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- then he set it on fire.\N- Hey, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.89,0:53:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't the computer\Njust kill Connor then?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.07,0:53:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why this elaborate scheme\Nwith the Terminator?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.04,0:53:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It had no choice. Their\Ndefense grid was smashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.36,0:54:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd won. Taking out Connor\Nthen would make no difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.79,0:54:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Skynet had to wipe out\Nhis entire existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.94,0:54:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that when you captured the lab complex\Nand found that... uh, what is it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.89,0:54:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... the time\Ndisplacement equipment?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.26,0:54:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. The Terminator\Nhad already gone through.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.53,0:54:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Connor sent me to intercept,\Nand they blew the whole place.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.00,0:54:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you supposed get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.15,0:54:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.39,0:54:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody goes home.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.90,0:54:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody else comes through.\NIt's just him and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.72,0:56:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just him and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.13,0:56:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you bring any weapons,\Nsomething more advanced?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.13,0:56:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have ray guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.84,0:56:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ray guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.97,0:56:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me a piece of\Nfuture technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.57,0:56:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You go naked. Something about the\Nfield generated by a living organism.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.88,0:56:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nothing dead will go.\N- Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.11,0:56:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- I didn't build the fucking thing!\N- OK, OK. But this...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.45,0:56:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- Cyborg, if it's metal...\N- Surrounded by living tissue!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.06,0:56:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Right, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.11,0:56:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is great stuff. I could\Nmake a career out of this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.11,0:56:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You see how clever this part is? How\Nit doesn't require a shred of proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.98,0:57:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And most paranoid delusions are\Nintricate, but this is brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.35,0:57:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why were the other\Ntwo women killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.76,0:57:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of the records\Nwere lost in the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.97,0:57:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Skynet knew almost nothing about Connor's\Nmother. Her full name, where she lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.86,0:57:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They just knew the city. The\NTerminator was just being systematic.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.55,0:57:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Uh-huh. Well, let's go back to...\N- Look, you have heard enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.47,0:57:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have answered your questions!\NNow I have to see Sarah Connor!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.91,0:57:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm afraid that's not up to me.\N- Then why am I talking to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.43,0:57:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- Because I can help you.\N- Who is in authority here?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.45,0:57:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Reese...\N- Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.83,0:57:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You still don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.57,0:57:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll find her.\NThat's what he does!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.07,0:57:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all he does!\NYou can't stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.81,0:57:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll wade through you, reach down her\Nthroat, and pull her fucking heart out!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.08,0:57:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Doc.\N- Let... let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.48,0:57:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.76,0:58:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- So, Reese is crazy?\N- In technical terminology...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.58,0:58:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a loon.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.51,0:58:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sarah, this is what\Nthey call body armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.28,0:58:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Our TAC guys wear these. It'll\Nstop a twelve-gauge round.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.45,0:58:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This other individual must have been wearing\None under his coat. Feel that. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.79,0:58:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What about when he punched\Nthrough the windshield?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.89,0:58:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He was probably on PCP.\NBroke every bone in his hand
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.58,0:58:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and wouldn't feel it for hours.\NThere was this guy once...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.44,0:58:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- You see this scar?\N- Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.02,0:58:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.85,0:58:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a couch in this other room. Why don't\Nyou stretch out and try to get some sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.04,0:58:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be at least an hour before your\Nmother gets here from Big Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.58,0:58:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- I can't sleep.\N- Try.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.68,0:58:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it may not look it, but\Nthat couch is very comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.20,0:58:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be perfectly safe. We got\Nthirty cops in this building.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.88,0:58:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.85,0:59:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good night.\N- Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.56,0:59:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a friend of Sarah Connor.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.60,0:59:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told that she's here.\NCould I see her, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.78,0:59:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No. You can't see her.\NShe's making a statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.46,0:59:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where is she?\N- Look, it may take a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.25,0:59:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,if you want to wait, there's\Na bench over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.45,0:59:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.23,1:00:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.56,1:00:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Gunshot!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.62,1:00:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is it, terrorists?\N- Let's go! Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.78,1:00:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.34,1:00:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.43,1:00:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on! Come on!\N- He's got an automatic weapon!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.95,1:01:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it, move it, move it, move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.66,1:01:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened\Nto the lights?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.32,1:01:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.26,1:01:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Automatic weapons!\NLock and load! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.21,1:02:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.05,1:02:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.52,1:02:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.54,1:02:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sarah!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.46,1:03:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Reese!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.79,1:03:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.75,1:03:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}KFLB news time 4:36.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.19,1:03:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the top story of the hour, the\Nlargest single law enforcement{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.47,1:03:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mobilization in California\Nhistory is currently underway.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.96,1:03:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Police in five Southern counties...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.61,1:04:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}are engaged in a massive\Nmanhunt for an unident...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.34,1:04:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.74,1:04:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get\Nthis off the road.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.49,1:04:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- You cold?\N- Freezing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.42,1:04:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Reese...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.08,1:05:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a first name?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.51,1:05:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.90,1:05:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyle... what's it like\Nwhen you go through time?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.37,1:05:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,White light.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.68,1:05:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.28,1:05:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's like being born maybe.\N- Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.27,1:05:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I caught one back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.87,1:05:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- You mean you got shot?\N- It's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.58,1:05:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- We got to get you to a doctor.\N- It's OK. Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.15,1:05:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean,\Nforget it? Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.75,1:05:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this off.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.21,1:05:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.16,1:05:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,See, it passed right\Nthrough the meat.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.77,1:06:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is going to make me puke.\NWould you just talk about something?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.62,1:06:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.74,1:06:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Anything.\NJust talk. Tell me about my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.96,1:06:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He's about my height.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.27,1:06:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He has your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.61,1:06:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he like?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.87,1:06:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You trust him. He's got a strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.18,1:06:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd die for John Connor.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.10,1:06:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... at least now I know\Nwhat to name him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.47,1:06:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't suppose you\Nknow who the father is,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.89,1:06:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,so I won't tell him to get\Nlost when I meet him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.83,1:06:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,John never said much about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.73,1:06:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- I know he dies before the war...\N- Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.24,1:06:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.07,1:06:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So, was it John that sent you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.64,1:06:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I volunteered.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.54,1:07:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.95,1:07:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a chance to meet the\Nlegend... Sarah Connor.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.89,1:07:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Taught her son to fight, organize,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.34,1:07:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,prepare from when he was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.73,1:07:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,When you were in hiding\Nbefore the war...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.78,1:07:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're talking about things I\Nhaven't done yet in the past tense.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.32,1:07:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's driving me crazy.\N- Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.19,1:07:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you have\Nthe right person?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.89,1:07:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.23,1:07:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Do I look like\Nthe mother of the future?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.74,1:07:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, am I tough? Organized?\NI can't even balance my checkbook.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.68,1:07:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Reese, I didn't ask for this\Nhonor, and I don't want it! Any of it!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.64,1:08:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your son gave me a message to\Ngive to you. Made me memorize it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.96,1:08:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"Thank you, Sarah, for your\Ncourage through the dark years.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.11,1:08:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help you with what you must soon face\Nexcept to say that the future is not set.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.78,1:08:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be stronger than\Nyou imagine you can be.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.47,1:08:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You must survive, or I will\Nnever exist". That's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.58,1:08:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good field dressing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.68,1:08:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You like it? It's my first.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.49,1:08:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get some sleep.\NIt will be light soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.23,1:08:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.22,1:08:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk to me some more.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.33,1:08:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.13,1:09:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me about where you're from.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.93,1:09:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.04,1:09:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay down by day, but at\Nnight you can move around.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.78,1:09:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have to be careful\Nbecause the HKs use infrared.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.62,1:09:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're not too bright. John\Ntaught us ways to dust them.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.17,1:09:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when the infiltrators\Nstarted to appear.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.97,1:09:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The Terminators were the\Nnewest... The worst.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.17,1:09:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Traversing your sector\Nin search mode.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.21,1:09:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}750 meters north of your position.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.58,1:09:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Understood. 750 meters north.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.21,1:09:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.95,1:09:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Intercept. Over.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.83,1:09:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There are scavenger teams\Nin that quadrant.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.44,1:10:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Avoid contact. Repeat, avoid\Ncontact. We'll get them later.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.44,1:10:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger, echo leader.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.28,1:10:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- Sector niner, what's your status?\N- Situation normal.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.37,1:10:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Firebase, what's your status? Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.81,1:10:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Reese. DN384...\N- Right. Let him in.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.20,1:10:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Any infiltrators at\Nthe shopping mall?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.22,1:10:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No problem. They were clean. We're\Ncutting short the patrol. Over.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.43,1:10:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger, Yankee-1-7.\NYou are clear to return.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.02,1:12:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Terminator! Terminator!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.12,1:13:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I was dreaming about dogs.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.69,1:13:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We use them to spot Terminators.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.36,1:13:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your world is pretty terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.48,1:14:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy, you got a dead\Ncat in there, or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.08,1:14:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck you, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.01,1:14:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddamn!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.68,1:14:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.49,1:15:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, is this enough?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.69,1:15:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's enough. I don't\Nwant to ask where you got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.07,1:15:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm coming.\N- We need a room.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.90,1:15:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right.\N- With a kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.37,1:15:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have one with a kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.24,1:15:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.64,1:15:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I am dying for a shower.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.98,1:15:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We should check your bandage, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.86,1:15:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Later. I'm going out for supplies.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.19,1:15:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.45,1:16:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't tell you where I am,\Nmom. I was told not to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.99,1:16:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, but, honey, I need to\Nknow where I can reach you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.21,1:16:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You tell me to hide out up here at\Nthe cabin like some fugitive and...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.63,1:16:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and you won't tell me what's\Ngoing on? I am worried sick, dear.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.53,1:16:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.53,1:16:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- OK, here's the number. Ready?\N- Yes. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.64,1:16:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's 408-555...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.20,1:16:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- 1439.{\i0}\N- Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.44,1:16:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- Room 9. Got it?{\i0}\N- Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.85,1:16:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- I've got it.\N{\i1}- I've got to go.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.84,1:16:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry I can't tell you more\Nright now. I love you, mom.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.15,1:16:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, too, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.98,1:17:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- Tiki motel.{\i0}\N- Give me your address there.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.97,1:17:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What have we got?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.98,1:17:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mothballs.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.72,1:17:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Corn syrup.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.58,1:17:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ammonia. What's for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.59,1:17:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Plastique.\N- Mmm, that sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.79,1:17:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.99,1:17:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nitroglycerin, basically.\NIt's a bit more stable.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.73,1:17:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned to make it\Nwhen I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.36,1:17:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure there's\Nnone on the threads.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.75,1:17:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.25,1:18:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw the end cap on.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.95,1:18:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Very gently.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.23,1:18:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You must've had a fun childhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.23,1:18:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.20,1:18:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Six more like that, and\NI'll get started on the fuses.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.28,1:18:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll find us, won't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.12,1:18:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.50,1:18:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll never be over, will it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.17,1:19:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me. I'm shaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.37,1:19:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Some legend, huh? You must\Nbe pretty disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.56,1:19:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.37,1:19:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyle...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.88,1:19:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The women in your time...\Nwhat are they like?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.72,1:19:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Good fighters.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.02,1:19:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.32,1:19:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Was there someone special?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.92,1:19:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Someone?\N- A girl. You know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.13,1:19:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.35,1:19:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.56,1:20:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Never?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.06,1:20:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.30,1:20:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So much pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.72,1:20:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pain can be controlled.\NYou just disconnect it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.49,1:20:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So you feel nothing?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.73,1:20:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,John Connor gave me a\Npicture of you once.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.54,1:20:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know why at the\Ntime. It was very old...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.48,1:20:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Torn... faded.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.35,1:20:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You were young like you are now.\NYou seemed just... a little sad.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.96,1:20:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to always wonder what you\Nwere thinking at that moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.18,1:21:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I memorized every line,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.00,1:21:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,every curve.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.37,1:21:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I came across time for you, Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.26,1:21:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you. I always have.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.50,1:21:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have said that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.24,1:23:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Think fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.51,1:24:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Trade places!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.94,1:24:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster! Drive faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.95,1:25:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyle!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.15,1:25:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.50,1:26:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.43,1:26:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Whoa!\N- Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.82,1:26:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.03,1:27:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.00,1:27:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.28,1:27:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyle. Come on, get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.68,1:27:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.61,1:27:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyle? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.58,1:28:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me! Get out! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.36,1:28:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.20,1:28:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.84,1:28:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.09,1:28:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.24,1:30:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sarah!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.64,1:30:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyle!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.25,1:30:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kyle. Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.96,1:30:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it, Kyle. We got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.75,1:31:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.36,1:31:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.49,1:32:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.66,1:32:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing?\N- Cover, so he can't track us.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.99,1:32:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on. No, Kyle!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.97,1:32:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on! Come on!\N- Leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.92,1:32:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.73,1:33:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it, Reese!\NOn your feet, soldier!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.77,1:33:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On your feet! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.88,1:34:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Back. Go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.06,1:34:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Run, Sarah.\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.40,1:34:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.40,1:35:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.24,1:35:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.24,1:36:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.56,1:38:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're terminated, fucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.41,1:39:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.09,1:40:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}6450 Bellingham Avenue, Super\NTrader. 6450 Bellingham Avenue.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.92,1:40:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tape 7, November 10. Where was I?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.73,1:40:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's most difficult for me is trying to\Ndecide what to tell you and what not to.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.30,1:40:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess I have a while yet before you're\Nold enough to even understand these tapes.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.72,1:40:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They're more for me at this point,\Njust so that I can get it straight.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.30,1:41:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- Gasolina, por favor.\N- ¿Cuánto?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.21,1:41:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- Llena el tanque.{\i0}\N- Fill her up, {\i1}sí.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.95,1:41:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I tell you about your\Nfather? Boy, that's a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.42,1:41:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Will it affect your decision to send him\Nhere, knowing that he is your father?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.03,1:41:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't send Kyle,\Nyou can never be.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.73,1:41:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,God, a person could go\Ncrazy thinking about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.87,1:41:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I will tell you.\NI owe him that.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.75,1:41:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it'll help if...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.35,1:41:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that in the few\Nhours that we had together...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.36,1:42:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We loved a lifetime's worth.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.56,1:42:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Usted es muy hermosa, señora,\Ny tengo pena decirle{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.88,1:42:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}que me de cinco dolares americanos,\Npero si no, mi padre me va a pegar.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.79,1:42:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- What did he just say?\N- He says you're very beautiful, señora...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.79,1:42:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and he's ashamed to ask you for five\NAmerican dollars for his picture,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.16,1:42:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but if he doesn't, his\Nfather will beat him.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.20,1:42:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty good hustle, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.20,1:42:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- Cuatro\N- Sí, sí.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.94,1:42:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gracias.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.84,1:42:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}¡Miren, miren!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.79,1:42:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}¡Allá! ¡Viene una tormenta!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.22,1:42:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he just say?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.65,1:42:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He said there's a storm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.24,1:42:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
